/design_handoff_*/

# Remotion brand-video workspace — local only. Standalone package with its own
# node_modules and tsconfig, unrelated to the app build or deploy. Its one
# committed trace is `video` in the root tsconfig's `exclude`: without it the
# root `include` globs pull `video/src/**` into the app's type-check. ESLint and
# knip need no entry — neither walks in there. Inert on a clone without it.
/video/

# Historical import workbooks — contain personal data, must never be committed
# (any filename containing "Evidencija", e.g. "Kopija datoteke Evidencija_….numbers")
*Evidencija*
